  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. In 6/8, main beats are felt as:\n\n- A) Two beats per bar (compound duple)\n- B) Six equal beats\n- C) Three quarter-note beats\n- D) One beat only\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Tap foot on main beat when dictating rhythm.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. Syncopation stresses:\n\n- A) Weak beats or offbeats\n- B) Only beat one always\n- C) Silence only\n- D) Every bar line\n\n**Answer:** A",
